IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-passports`

-- Passports Act 2007, ss 8, 9, 14, 15, 19, 20, 24(4), 25 to 28, 45, 46, penalties and s 52 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_passports-act-2007.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 8, 9, 14, 15`

#ASSERT `the longest ordinary passport validity in years` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the temporary travel document validity in years` EQUALS 1

#ASSERT `the Act forbids extending it` `a Singapore ordinary passport` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Act forbids extending it` `a Singapore ordinary passport` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Act forbids extending it` `a Singapore diplomatic or official passport` TRUE
#ASSERT `the Act forbids extending it` `a Singapore temporary travel document` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Act forbids extending it` `a Singapore document of identity` TRUE

