§ `penalties`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `the business of selling passports` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `selling a passport` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `damaging a passport` EQUALS 3000
