#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `making a false passport` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `lending one's own passport recklessly` EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to surrender on demand` EQUALS 6
